= Gustav Radbruch

Gustav Radbruch is [? if chancellor = "Radbruch": the current Chancellor and ?][? if president = "Radbruch": the current President and ?] a renowned legal scholar and long-time SPD justice minister.


- @judiciary_
- @constitutional_reform_
- @chancellor
- @president
- @root: Return to main


@judiciary_
title: Judicial Affairs
subtitle: Enact judicial reforms.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and spd_in_government and justice_minister_party = "SPD"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not spd_in_government : The SPD is not currently in government. ?][? if justice_minister_party != "SPD" : We do not have the Justice Ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; judiciary_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: judiciary


@constitutional_reform_
title: Constitutional Reform
subtitle: Pursue reforms of the inadequate Weimar Constitution.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and spd_in_government and justice_minister_party = "SPD" and ((in_weimar_coalition) or (spd_in_majority) or (in_left_front) or (in_popular_front)) and judicial_reform >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not spd_in_government : The SPD is not currently in government. ?] [? if justice_minister_party != "SPD" : We do not have the Justice Ministry. ?] [? if judicial_reform < 2: The judiciary is unlikely to tolerate progressive constitutional changes. ?] [? if not ((in_weimar_coalition) or (spd_in_majority) or (in_left_front) or (in_popular_front)) : Our current governing coalition will not support constitutional reforms. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; constitutional_reform_timer -= 12
go-to: constitutional_reform

@chancellor
title: Use the Chancellorship
subtitle: As the current Chancellor, Radbruch can make use of their position to further our goals.
view-if: chancellor == "Radbruch"
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
go-to: chancellor

@president
title: Use the Presidency
subtitle: As the current President, Radbruch can make use of their position to further our goals.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
view if: president == "Radbruch"

